############ 2. Is domain-certificate (served) produced by a Certificate, or hand-applied? ############
ownerRefs= managed-by=
  (no cert-manager cert -> domain-certificate)
gardenerCert domain-certificate secret=domain-certificate state=Ready

############ 3. infra HelmRelease: source (git repo we could PR) + does it template these secrets? ############
chart= sourceKind= sourceName= interval=1m
-- the source object (where the chart values live) --
/

