error: the server doesn't have a resource type ""

############ 4. VERDICT on durability risk ############
  - If domain-certificate-ca has NO cert-manager/gardener Certificate producing it (hand-applied), then Flux
    reconciling 'infra' will NOT overwrite its DATA (infra only references it by name via caSecret). => stable.
  - If a Certificate DOES produce it, that Certificate is the durable knob.
DONE
